{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the Master of Pasta!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this single-player simulation game, you run your very own pasta restaurant \u2014 as both the head chef and the manager. Start each day with a limited budget: buy ingredients, pay your waiter and dishwasher, and don\u2019t forget the rent! Prepare and deliver customer orders on time and without mistakes to earn money and increase your restaurant\u2019s rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful: If you serve incomplete dishes, customers will be unhappy and your rating will drop. Some days, surprise characters will visit your restaurant \u2014 some will lend a hand, while others might cause a bit of chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for fun-filled moments of resource management, time pressure, and strategic planning. With charming visuals and a cozy atmosphere, it's your time to shine in the kitchen!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883270?t=1753378184","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883270?t=1753378184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/4d29616a48bb4a4e677745f17448cc9c8c927765/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753378184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/4d29616a48bb4a4e677745f17448cc9c8c927765/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753378184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the Master of Pasta!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this single-player simulation game, you run your very own pasta restaurant \u2014 as both the head chef and the manager. Start each day with a limited budget: buy ingredients, pay your waiter and dishwasher, and don\u2019t forget the rent! Prepare and deliver c